From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:33:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/48] Open Bilibili's cover manager from the room tab

The Windows client manages the live cover in a web page
(hime-live-cover): upload, crop, history, quality advice and review.
Generalize the face-verification window into BilibiliPageWindow, which
hosts such pages with the session in a non-persistent WebKit store and
provides the web-mode pieces they fall back to without biliBridgePc: a
file picker for uploads, page-initiated close, alerts and confirms. The
room tab gains "Manage cover...".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
